Node ids let you rerun exactly the failures: `pytest tests/test_login.py::test_locked tests/test_pay.py::test_card`. CI jobs often do this as a separate "rerun failed" step and post the list to the PR. (For tests inside classes, classname also contains the class name, so a real tool maps `tests.test_login.TestLogin` → `tests/test_login.py::TestLogin::test_x`.)

